---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
import { CONTACT } from '../lib/site';
---
<InfoPage title="Copyright & takedowns" eyebrow="Policy">
  <p><strong>Video.</strong> We embed only official uploads from promotions' own channels (such as WWE, WWE Vault, AEW, NJPW, TNA and NWA) using YouTube's standard embed. Otherwise we link to licensed services. We never link to unofficial uploads.</p>
  <p><strong>Images.</strong> We use only our own images, licensed images, or promotional images within the promoter's terms.</p>
  <p><strong>Writing and ratings.</strong> Reviews are original. Results, dates and match times are facts. Dave Meltzer's star ratings are quoted individually with credit to him and the Wrestling Observer.</p>
  <p><strong>Takedown requests.</strong> If you hold rights to something on this site and want it removed, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a> with the page address and the material concerned. We act on requests promptly.</p>
  <p class="muted">The Workrate Report is an independent fan site and isn't affiliated with WWE, AEW, NJPW, TNA, the NWA or any other promotion. All trademarks belong to their owners.</p>
</InfoPage>
